Package: simple-ldapd
Version: ${VERSION}
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libssl3 (>= 3.0.0), libc6 (>= 2.31), libsqlite3-0
Maintainer: SimpleDaemons <support@simpledaemons.com>
Description: Lightweight LDAPv3 directory daemon
 simple-ldapd is a single-host LDAPv3 directory for SSO via LDAP bind.
 Default CLI names match OpenLDAP (ldapsearch, …). Rebuild with
 -DLDAP_CLI_PREFIX=simple- if both must share PATH.
Homepage: https://github.com/SimpleDaemons/simple-ldapd
